<title>TAIWAN: Taiwan Flour seen tendering for 68,000t U.S. wheat.</title>
<headline>Taiwan Flour seen tendering for 68,000t U.S. wheat.</headline>
<dateline>TAIPEI 1996-10-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Taiwan Flour Mills Association is expected to place a tender within two weeks for two 34,000-tonne shipments of U.S. wheat, local traders said on Tuesday.</p>
<p>Further details were not immediately available.</p>
</text>
